title: anastasia_idle_1
tags:
---
Anastasia: Mm-mm-mmm... mm-mm-mm-mmm... <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
Anastasia: The wind's gone soft today. It used to carry voices. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
===

title: anastasia_idle_2
tags:
---
Anastasia: Lirael, sweetling... she wanders the orchard when the bees are kind. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
Anastasia: She'll be back when the shadows lean east. She always is. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
===

title: anastasia_idle_3
tags:
---
Anastasia: They sleep beneath us, you know. Stone holding its breath. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
Anastasia: When the right note finds them, they remember they were tall. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
===

title: anastasia_idle_4
tags:
---
Anastasia: My grandmother used to say... what waits, ripens. What rushes... <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
Anastasia: ...mm. I forget the rest. The rocker remembers it for me. <<tag character:Anastasia mood:idle>>
===
